{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521820001:1":{"text":"Excuse me, are you Granny Alle?","source_cn":"呃……您是艾努尔婆婆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED2C5D7A987BED1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521820002:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521820003:0":{"text":"Why isn't she saying anything?","source_cn":"她怎么一点反应也没有？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1564E80320B3BBDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1521820003":{"text":"Why isn't she saying anything?","source_cn":"她怎么一点反应也没有？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1564E80320B3BBDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521820004:0":{"text":"Oh, right...","source_cn":"是、是哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x300E2FFEFAC74AD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521820005:0":{"text":"Granny Alle, do you have anything left behind by Perseus? We're preparing his funeral and wanted to bury some of his belongings with him.","source_cn":"艾努尔婆婆，您这里有没有珀尔修斯留下的东西？我们在筹备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5016B47EF44D807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521820006:0":{"text":"Perseus...?","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6EBF4FD4C36BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521820007:1":{"text":"Yes! Do you remember Perseus?","source_cn":"……是的！您还记得珀尔修斯吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80B82734E0C4FEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521820008:0":{"text":"Perseus...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B7C3EBF91B477D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1521820009:0":{"text":"Granny Alle rises unsteadily, her steps slow but deliberate as she disappears into the house.","source_cn":"艾努尔颤颤巍巍地站起身，走进屋子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x550314BE4A57C934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1521820010:1":{"text":"Moments later, she emerges, holding a pair of heavy gauntlets.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BBB1B40B4493FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521820011:1":{"text":"What's this?","source_cn":"这是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x456E41E096E54C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::2":{"text":"Worn Gauntlets","source_cn":"破旧的手甲","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE44F683ABFC45AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521820012:0":{"text":"These were Soter's... Perseus brought them back... for me.","source_cn":"索特的……盔甲。珀尔修斯……带回来它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB51EB3A5D567B2EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521820013:1":{"text":"Was Soter your grandson?","source_cn":"索特是您的家人？您那位加入军队的孙子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF113B5799075E7CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521820014:0":{"text":"Yes... Soter was a good boy.","source_cn":"索特……对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89930D0800582CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521820015:1":{"text":"I can't take these.","source_cn":"那我不能带走它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35924EE6FC8B0B61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521820016:1":{"text":"Perseus brought these gauntlets back for you to remember your grandson and to help ease the pain of losing him. They belong with you.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯将这副手甲带回来，是想给您留作纪念，缓解您失去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD700D0CFA67B27D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521820017:0":{"text":"It's alright, Granny Alle. If Perseus didn't leave anything behind, don't worry about it. I can always look somewhere else.","source_cn":"没关系，婆婆。珀尔修斯没有留下东西的话也不用勉强，我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35000AF3A58BBD8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521820018:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521820019:0":{"text":"After a moment of silence, Granny Alle steps back inside and returns with a neatly folded set of clothes.","source_cn":"艾努尔沉默了一会儿，又从屋内拿出了一套整洁的衣服。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22291FC78E1645F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521820020:0":{"text":"I made these...","source_cn":"我做的，衣服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE03E0F71F17A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521820021:1":{"text":"Perseus never wore them...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯……没来得及，穿上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93EB0124983E0494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521820022:0":{"text":"... I understand. When Perseus is laid to rest, I'll make sure he's dressed in these clothes.","source_cn":"……我明白了，婆婆。珀尔修斯下葬的时候，我会让人帮他换...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC050CF9F432DEEE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521820023:0":{"text":"Good... That's good...","source_cn":"好……好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC81C039FDD49B0F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1521820024:1":{"text":"Abundius keeps talking about Perseus, and Granny Alle just nods along mechanically.","source_cn":"","status":"matched",